-- Through the outcome: a fracture set by orthopaedic surgery after an accident, read as "chỉnh hình"
-- (finding X3), is not paid.
#ASSERT `the outcome of` (`with the circumstances` (LIST `cosmetic treatment, cosmetic surgery, or orthopaedic correction`) `the accident claim`) EQUALS `not payable` (LIST (`excluded by` `Article 11.11`))
-- 2.11 lists tuberculosis ("lao các loại") as a special disease, covered from the second year;
-- 11.9 excludes it outright, so that cover never pays (finding X22). The same second-year special
-- disease without tuberculosis is paid.
#ASSERT `the outcome of` (`with the circumstances` (LIST `malaria, tuberculosis or an occupational disease`) (`with the history` (`a renewal of` `the 2025 standard contract` `continuous since` (YMD 2025 1 1)) (`with the illness` (JUST `a special disease`) `the illness stay claim`))) EQUALS `not payable` (LIST (`excluded by` `Article 11.9`))

§§ `Several layers at once`

-- Special contract for 2027 (A and B 100 million, C 50 million), renewed continuously from a 2026
-- contract whose scope C was 30 million. A special disease, a 12-day stay on 1-12 Mar 2027 costing
-- 9,000,000, of which another contract paid 1,000,000.
--   cover: Article 1 met; in force; 11.17's first year ended 1 Jan 2027; row 2's 365 days from 1 Jan
--     2026 have run. The 20-million increase has its own 365 days from 1 Jan 2027, not run, so only
--     30 million is available (F27).
--   programme: special (50 million > 20 million).
--   cap: 10 x 0.5% x 30 million + 2 x 0.3% x 30 million = 1,500,000 + 180,000 = 1,680,000.
--   cost: 9,000,000 - 1,000,000 (Article 3) = 8,000,000, more than the cap.
--   III.4: nothing paid before this year; 1,680,000 is under 30 million.
`the layered claim` MEANS
    `with the contract` (`a contract` (YMD 2027 1 1) (YMD 2027 12 31) 12 (JUST 100000000) (JUST 100000000) (JUST 50000000) 1 FALSE FALSE NOTHING)
        (`with the history` (`a renewal of` (`a previous contract` (YMD 2026 1 1) (YMD 2026 12 31) (JUST 100000000) (JUST 100000000) (JUST 30000000)) `continuous since` (YMD 2026 1 1))
            (`with the illness` (JUST `a special disease`)
                (`with another contract paying` 1000000
                    (`with the event and treatment on` (YMD 2027 3 1)
                        (`with a stay` (YMD 2027 3 1) (YMD 2027 3 12) 9000000 0 `the illness stay claim`)))))

#ASSERT `the outcome of` `the layered claim` EQUALS `payable` 1680000
